  "content": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Design an air stripping water treatment column to remove 1,1,1-Trichloroethane (15) from the water, using the following information and figure:"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "• Use 2-in Intalox saddles for packing (area to volume ratio is 118 m1)."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "• Column diameter = 2 ft"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "• Liquid mass transfer coefficient = 16.5 cm/hr."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "• Air-to-water ratio = 65"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "• Henry's constant (dimensionless) = 0.464"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "• Also consider a safety factor (SF) = 20%."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Water Inlet"
    },
